3546:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32l4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             Auto wait will work but fort a very short time, discarding
3547:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32l4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             its intended benefit (except specific case of high load of CPU
3548:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32l4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             or DMA transfers which can justify usage of auto wait).
